### Concesiones rol-recurso: el permiso (modalidad JWT). Pega un access token válido.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = <access_token>

### getAll: 169 concesiones (ADMIN 87, LOGISTICA 30, BASCULA 21, PLANTA 13, FINANZAS 18)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### permisos de un rol (BASCULA = 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles?roleId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### roles que conceden un recurso
GET {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles?resourceId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### grant: conceder un recurso a PLANTA (4) -> 201 (200 si se reactiva; 409 si ya está activo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleId": 4,
  "resourceId": 1
}

### deactivate: retira solo ese permiso
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles/170/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### reactivate
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/resource-roles/170/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
